### ====================================================
### BIHAR CRM TELEPHONY APIs
### ====================================================

### 1. Webhook (RINGING)
POST http://localhost:5000/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "RINGING",
  "extension": "56001",
  "callerId": "08307753758",
  "calledId": "56001",
  "durationSeconds": 0,
  "timestamp": "2026-11-02T10:24:15.123Z"
}

### 2. Webhook (ANSWERED)
POST http://localhost:5000/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "ANSWERED",
  "extension": "56001",
  "callerId": "08307753758",
  "calledId": "56001",
