### ----------------------------------------------------

### 4. Pickup Call (no body needed)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/pickup
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5. Make Outbound Call
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientNumber": "08307753758",
  "grievanceId": ""
}

### 6. Agent Status (auto-reconnects if disconnected)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/agent/status
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 7. Active Call Details
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/details
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 8. Call History
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/history
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
